43:37.760 --> 43:38.480
Doesn't the existence

43:38.480 --> 43:39.340
of that button

43:39.340 --> 43:40.980
prove that I have a path?

43:41.540 --> 43:42.120
Doesn't that prove

43:42.120 --> 43:42.900
I am not trapped

43:42.900 --> 43:44.120
behind an excluded cut?

43:44.720 --> 43:45.940
That is the exact illusion

43:45.940 --> 43:46.480
that keeps

43:46.480 --> 43:47.800
these systems functioning

43:47.800 --> 43:49.020
and it is what

43:49.020 --> 43:49.820
theorem six

43:49.820 --> 43:51.300
meticulously dismantles.

43:52.100 --> 43:52.600
Theorem six

43:52.600 --> 43:53.600
is about the profound

43:53.600 --> 43:55.520
danger of the nominal exit.

43:56.200 --> 43:56.980
Nominal meaning

43:56.980 --> 43:58.600
an exit in name only.

43:58.600 --> 43:59.340
Exactly.

43:59.740 --> 44:00.480
The theorem asks

44:00.480 --> 44:01.540
a rigorous question.

44:02.360 --> 44:03.660
Does the mere existence

44:03.660 --> 44:05.260
of an exit transition

44:05.260 --> 44:06.680
in the permitted graph

44:06.680 --> 44:08.600
automatically guarantee

44:08.600 --> 44:09.320
that you can reach

44:09.320 --> 44:10.460
a corrective state

44:10.460 --> 44:11.860
in the obligation

44:11.860 --> 44:12.920
preserving graph?

44:13.640 --> 44:15.000
The mathematical proof

44:15.000 --> 44:15.800
shows that it

44:15.800 --> 44:17.200
emphatically does not.

44:17.200 --> 44:17.960
Why not?

44:18.180 --> 44:18.580
Why not?

44:19.080 --> 44:20.140
If the door is open

44:20.140 --> 44:20.820
why can't I walk

44:20.820 --> 44:21.260
through it?

44:21.760 --> 44:22.340
Because taking

44:22.340 --> 44:23.280
that permitted exit

44:23.280 --> 44:24.640
might force you

44:24.640 --> 44:25.580
to destroy your own

44:25.580 --> 44:26.220
life to do it.

44:26.960 --> 44:28.380
Imagine the Gig Economy

44:28.380 --> 44:29.280
app gives you

44:29.280 --> 44:30.560
a permitted exit line

44:30.560 --> 44:32.260
the deactivate button.

44:32.940 --> 44:33.940
You can technically

44:33.940 --> 44:34.420
