44:34.420 --> 44:35.440
but what if the way

44:35.440 --> 44:36.600
the system is designed

44:36.600 --> 44:37.920
means that pressing

44:37.920 --> 44:38.420
that button

44:38.420 --> 44:39.980
instantly forfeits

44:39.980 --> 44:40.480
the money you've

44:40.480 --> 44:41.420
already earned that month.

44:41.820 --> 44:43.200
Money you desperately

44:43.200 --> 44:43.960
need to pay rent

44:43.960 --> 44:44.660
and feed your family.

44:44.660 --> 44:47.360
Or what if you are

44:47.360 --> 44:48.260
an engineer

44:48.260 --> 44:49.240
at a tech company

44:49.240 --> 44:50.160
and you realize

44:50.160 --> 44:51.020
the product you were

44:51.020 --> 44:51.920
building is deeply

44:51.920 --> 44:52.760
unethical.

44:53.220 --> 44:54.120
You want to blow

44:54.120 --> 44:54.500
