contract includes

44:56.960 --> 44:58.280
an incredibly aggressive

44:58.280 --> 44:59.360
non-disclosure agreement

44:59.360 --> 45:00.760
and a non-compete clause.

45:01.580 --> 45:02.840
The permitted exit

45:02.840 --> 45:03.680
quitting

