45:09.040 --> 45:09.500
In those cases

45:09.500 --> 45:10.440
the nominal exit

45:10.440 --> 45:11.580
is physically permitted

45:11.580 --> 45:11.980
yes

45:11.980 --> 45:13.700
but it does not exist

45:13.700 --> 45:14.760
in the obligation

45:14.760 --> 45:15.720
preserving graph

45:15.720 --> 45:17.280
because taking it

45:17.280 --> 45:18.380
