45:18.380 --> 45:19.120
your obligation

45:19.120 --> 45:20.140
to feed your children

45:20.140 --> 45:21.220
or destroying

45:21.220 --> 45:21.840
your career.

45:22.660 --> 45:23.520
So it's a fake exit.

45:24.080 --> 45:24.800
It's a trap door.

45:25.580 --> 45:26.280
It is a completely

45:26.280 --> 45:27.060
fake exit.

45:27.380 --> 45:27.940
It forces you

45:27.940 --> 45:28.740
