45:32.320 --> 45:33.680
a catastrophic breach

45:33.680 --> 45:34.480
of your duties

45:34.480 --> 45:35.180
and livelihood.

45:36.100 --> 45:37.300
That is not a true

45:37.300 --> 45:37.960
corrective path.

45:38.220 --> 45:39.500
A genuine corrective state

45:39.500 --> 45:40.440
must include

45:40.440 --> 45:41.460
a feasible way

45:41.460 --> 45:43.000
to safely wind down

45:43.000 --> 45:43.660
your commitments.

45:44.420 --> 45:45.340
If the only way out

45:45.340 --> 45:46.100
is mutually assured

45:46.100 --> 45:46.620
destruction

45:46.620 --> 45:48.820
you are still trapped

45:48.820 --> 45:50.040
behind the excluded cut.

45:50.520 --> 45:52.300
That is incredibly insidious

45:52.300 --> 45:53.160
because the system

45:53.160 --> 45:54.320
can point to the

45:54.320 --> 45:55.620
