45:55.620 --> 45:56.080
and say

45:56.080 --> 45:56.680
look

45:56.680 --> 45:57.660
you're free to leave

45:57.660 --> 45:58.360
at any time

45:58.360 --> 45:59.860
you're choosing to stay.

46:00.120 --> 46:01.640
It uses the illusion

46:01.640 --> 46:03.000
of the nominal exit

46:03.000 --> 46:04.380
to mask the reality

46:04.380 --> 46:05.540
of the excluded cut.

46:06.200 --> 46:07.100
And this doesn't

46:07.100 --> 46:07.620
usually happen

46:07.620 --> 46:08.440
all at once, right?

46:08.740 --> 46:09.740
The paper details

46:09.740 --> 46:10.440
how this loss

46:10.440 --> 46:11.460
of agency happens

46:11.460 --> 46:12.360
gradually.

46:13.060 --> 46:14.200
Yes, Flyxion explores

46:14.200 --> 46:15.820
