47:44.180 --> 47:45.900
where no corrective task

47:45.900 --> 47:47.440
is geometrically possible.

47:48.060 --> 47:48.760
You are fully

47:48.760 --> 47:50.320
completely captured.

47:50.800 --> 47:51.520
And this is the most

47:51.520 --> 47:52.120
crucial point.

47:52.620 --> 47:53.880
Increasing your task output

47:53.880 --> 47:55.120
getting more efficient

47:55.120 --> 47:56.260
working harder

47:56.260 --> 47:57.740
getting a higher score

47:57.740 --> 47:58.340
on the metrics

47:58.340 --> 47:59.480
does absolutely nothing

47:59.480 --> 48:00.580
to stop this depletion.

48:00.960 --> 48:02.060
Because task output

48:02.060 --> 48:03.220
and revision capacity

48:03.220 --> 48:04.980
are two totally separate

48:04.980 --> 48:06.480
mathematically distinct

48:06.480 --> 48:06.900
variables.

48:07.680 --> 48:08.180
You can be working

48:08.180 --> 48:09.320
