48:09.320 --> 48:10.240
you can be breaking

48:10.240 --> 48:11.160
company records

48:11.160 --> 48:12.580
completely unaware

48:12.580 --> 48:13.640
that the walls

48:13.640 --> 48:14.660
are closing in on you.

48:15.000 --> 48:15.860
Which brings us

48:15.860 --> 48:16.620
to a part of the paper

48:16.620 --> 48:17.200
that genuinely

48:17.200 --> 48:17.980
kept me awake.

48:18.480 --> 48:19.420
We have talked about

48:19.420 --> 48:19.860
the physical

48:19.860 --> 48:20.780
and legal traps

48:20.780 --> 48:21.960
but what if you are

48:21.960 --> 48:22.580
trapped in this

48:22.580 --> 48:23.400
depleted state

48:23.400 --> 48:24.960
behind an excluded cut

48:24.960 --> 48:26.880
serving an unverified purpose

48:26.880 --> 48:27.960
but you feel

48:27.960 --> 48:28.980
completely free.

48:29.300 --> 48:29.900
This is where

48:29.900 --> 48:30.700
Flaxen executes

48:30.700 --> 48:31.980
a brilliant pivot.

48:31.980 --> 48:33.460
We move from

48:33.460 --> 48:33.960
the physical

48:33.960 --> 48:35.140
geometry of choices

48:35.140 --> 48:36.680
into the psychology

48:36.680 --> 48:38.200
and epistemology

48:38.200 --> 48:38.800
of agency.

48:39.700 --> 48:40.500
The paper attacks

48:40.500 --> 48:41.060
the core

48:41.060 --> 48:42.220
fundamental assumption

48:42.220 --> 48:42.980
that almost every

48:42.980 --> 48:43.760
single human being

48:43.760 --> 48:44.540
makes about themselves.

48:45.260 --> 48:46.060
If I sincerely

48:46.060 --> 48:47.160
want this goal

48:47.160 --> 48:48.520
if I endorse it

48:48.520 --> 48:49.360
