about this corporate mission

49:02.380 --> 49:03.480
how could I possibly

49:03.480 --> 49:04.060
be trapped?

49:04.400 --> 49:04.920
My feelings

49:04.920 --> 49:05.540
are my own.

49:06.060 --> 49:07.400
Flaxen uses a concept

49:07.400 --> 49:08.940
from econometrics

49:08.940 --> 49:09.740
in Theorem 11

49:09.740 --> 49:10.820
called historical

49:10.820 --> 49:12.220
