49:23.460 --> 49:24.140
They are not

49:24.140 --> 49:24.680
a complete

49:24.680 --> 49:26.040
or reliable account

49:26.040 --> 49:26.860
of how the system

49:26.860 --> 49:27.860
actually arose.

49:27.860 --> 49:28.840
A rendering

49:28.840 --> 49:30.260
like an image

49:30.260 --> 49:30.740
generated

49:30.740 --> 49:31.880
on a computer screen.

49:32.100 --> 49:32.480
Exactly.

49:33.160 --> 49:33.860
It's a snapshot

49:33.860 --> 49:34.800
of the present moment.

49:36.180 --> 49:36.720
Theorem 11

49:36.720 --> 49:38.020
asks us to conduct

49:38.020 --> 49:39.120
another thought experiment.

49:39.960 --> 49:40.280
Imagine

49:40.280 --> 49:41.600
two entirely

49:41.600 --> 49:42.700
different historical

49:42.700 --> 49:43.260
timelines

49:43.260 --> 49:44.040
that lead

49:44.040 --> 49:44.620
to the exact

49:44.620 --> 49:45.200
