49:46.000 --> 49:46.420
Okay.

49:46.860 --> 49:47.560
I'm picturing it.

49:48.060 --> 49:49.020
In History 1

49:49.020 --> 49:50.160
you were presented

49:50.160 --> 49:51.020
with a wide array

49:51.020 --> 49:51.520
of options.

