50:19.040 --> 50:20.020
In both timelines

50:20.020 --> 50:21.140
you are flawlessly

50:21.140 --> 50:22.300
executing the task.

50:22.780 --> 50:23.560
You are compliant.

50:24.020 --> 50:25.100
You smile at work.

50:25.100 --> 50:27.020
The observable

50:27.020 --> 50:27.440
rendering

50:27.440 --> 50:28.260
of your behavior

50:28.260 --> 50:29.300
and even your

50:29.300 --> 50:30.100
internal feeling

50:30.100 --> 50:30.900
of going along

50:30.900 --> 50:31.360
with it

50:31.360 --> 50:32.320
is absolutely

50:32.320 --> 50:32.860
identical.

50:33.660 --> 50:34.340
The theorem

50:34.340 --> 50:35.080
proves that

50:35.080 --> 50:35.700
if those two

50:35.700 --> 50:36.580
radically different

50:36.580 --> 50:36.920
histories

50:36.920 --> 50:37.440
can produce

50:37.440 --> 50:38.160
the exact same

50:38.160 --> 50:38.660
present day

50:38.660 --> 50:39.120
rendering

50:39.120 --> 50:40.300
then no

50:40.300 --> 50:41.280
mathematical function

50:41.280 --> 50:42.360
or diagnostic tool

50:42.360 --> 50:43.380
that only looks

50:43.380 --> 50:43.920
at the present

50:43.920 --> 50:44.280
rendering

50:44.280 --> 50:45.360
can possibly

50:45.360 --> 50:45.780
tell you

50:45.780 --> 50:46.420
which history

50:46.420 --> 50:47.380
actually happened.

50:47.860 --> 50:48.340
Just looking at

50:48.340 --> 50:49.000
how happy

50:49.000 --> 50:49.560
and compliant

50:49.560 --> 50:50.340
I am right now

50:50.340 --> 50:50.720
gives me

50:50.720 --> 50:51.780
absolutely zero

50:51.780 --> 50:52.580
information about

50:52.580 --> 50:53.080
whether I

50:53.080 --> 50:54.260
freely chose

50:54.260 --> 50:54.860
this life

50:54.860 --> 50:55.360
or if I was

50:55.360 --> 50:55.720
engineered

50:55.720 --> 50:56.560
to accept it.

50:57.100 --> 50:57.380
The math

50:57.380 --> 50:57.900
says it

50:57.900 --> 50:58.480
explicitly

50:58.480 --> 50:59.620
excludes

50:59.620 --> 51:00.600
unique determination.

51:01.260 --> 51:01.600
It's like

51:01.600 --> 51:02.700
finding a footprint

51:02.700 --> 51:03.220
in the sand

51:03.220 --> 51:03.720
on a beach.

51:04.160 --> 51:04.540
You look at

51:04.540 --> 51:04.980
the footprint

51:04.980 --> 51:05.960
and you know

51:05.960 --> 51:06.820
a foot was there

51:06.820 --> 51:07.600
but looking

51:07.600 --> 51:08.440
at the indentation

51:08.440 --> 51:08.780
alone

51:08.780 --> 51:09.500
cannot tell you

51:09.500 --> 51:09.940
if the person

51:09.940 --> 51:10.480
was walking

51:10.480 --> 51:10.900
freely

51:10.900 --> 51:11.880
or if they

51:11.880 --> 51:12.200
were being

51:12.200 --> 51:12.720
dragged by

51:12.720 --> 51:13.300
their arms.

51:13.760 --> 51:14.240
The present

51:14.240 --> 51:15.540
state severely

51:15.540 --> 51:16.740
under-determines

51:16.740 --> 51:17.300
the history.

51:18.080 --> 51:18.420
And the paper

51:18.420 --> 51:19.000
backs this

51:19.000 --> 51:20.000
mathematical proof

51:20.000 --> 51:20.960
up with

51:20.960 --> 51:21.720
actual cognitive

51:21.720 --> 51:22.480
science right

51:22.480 --> 51:23.400
because as

51:23.400 --> 51:24.020
humans we

51:24.020 --> 51:24.420
don't just

51:24.420 --> 51:25.240
act compliant

51:25.240 --> 51:26.300
we actively

51:26.300 --> 51:27.800
creatively invent

51:27.800 --> 51:28.580
reasons to

51:28.580 --> 51:29.140
justify our

51:29.140 --> 51:29.680
compliance to

51:29.680 --> 51:30.180
ourselves.

51:30.700 --> 51:31.600
Yes Flyxion

51:31.600 --> 51:32.800
cites foundational

51:32.800 --> 51:33.760
empirical work

51:33.760 --> 51:34.260
in cognitive

51:34.260 --> 51:34.860
science to

51:34.860 --> 51:35.400
prove that our

51:35.400 --> 51:36.660
introspection is

51:36.660 --> 51:37.900
deeply flawed.

51:38.440 --> 51:39.080
Specifically they

51:39.080 --> 51:39.880
point to Nisbet

51:39.880 --> 51:40.560
and Wilson's

51:40.560 --> 51:41.240
famous research

51:41.240 --> 51:42.180
on verbal

51:42.180 --> 51:43.400
reports and

51:43.400 --> 51:43.760
the stunning

51:43.760 --> 51:44.420
choice blindness

51:44.420 --> 51:45.420
experiments conducted

51:45.420 --> 51:45.980
by Petter

51:45.980 --> 51:46.620
Johansson and

51:46.620 --> 51:47.240
his colleagues.

51:47.980 --> 51:48.400
Oh I have

51:48.400 --> 51:48.920
read about the

51:48.920 --> 51:49.480
choice blindness

51:49.480 --> 51:50.020
experiments.

51:50.280 --> 51:50.660
They are

51:50.660 --> 51:51.480
incredible.

51:51.720 --> 51:52.340
For the

51:52.340 --> 51:52.800
listeners who

51:52.800 --> 51:53.140
don't know

51:53.140 --> 51:54.020
researchers would

51:54.020 --> 51:54.320
show a

51:54.320 --> 51:55.060
participant two

51:55.060 --> 51:55.500
pictures of

51:55.500 --> 51:56.580
faces and

51:56.580 --> 51:57.160
ask them to

51:57.160 --> 51:57.600
point to the

51:57.600 --> 51:58.120
one they find

51:58.120 --> 51:58.680
more attractive.

51:59.480 --> 51:59.920
The participant

51:59.920 --> 52:00.520
points to

52:00.520 --> 52:01.000
face A.

52:01.660 --> 52:02.420
Then the

52:02.420 --> 52:03.160
researcher uses

52:03.160 --> 52:04.000
sleight of hand

52:04.000 --> 52:04.660
like a magic

52:04.660 --> 52:05.760
trick to hand

52:05.760 --> 52:06.340
the participant

52:06.340 --> 52:07.080
the picture of

52:07.080 --> 52:08.300
face B the

52:08.300 --> 52:08.820
one they didn't

52:08.820 --> 52:09.100
choose.

52:09.500 --> 52:10.120
The researcher

52:10.120 --> 52:11.180
then asks why

52:11.180 --> 52:11.640
did you choose

52:11.640 --> 52:12.100
this face?

52:12.960 --> 52:13.520
And a

52:13.520 --> 52:15.120
massive percentage

52:15.120 --> 52:15.840
of people will

52:15.840 --> 52:16.640
confidently stare

52:16.640 --> 52:18.000
at face B the

52:18.000 --> 52:18.820
face they literally

52:18.820 --> 52:19.680
rejected two

52:19.680 --> 52:21.040
seconds ago and

52:21.040 --> 52:22.200
invent elaborate

52:22.200 --> 52:24.380
sincere passionate

52:24.380 --> 52:25.360
reasons for why

52:25.360 --> 52:25.960
they chose it.

52:26.260 --> 52:26.940
They completely

52:26.940 --> 52:27.800
fail to notice

52:27.800 --> 52:28.220
the swap.

52:29.000 --> 52:29.940
It is a stunning

52:29.940 --> 52:30.960
demonstration of

52:30.960 --> 52:31.660
human psychology.

52:32.160 --> 52:32.700
People will say

52:32.700 --> 52:33.400
things like I

52:33.400 --> 52:34.020
chose this one

52:34.020 --> 52:34.640
because I prefer

52:34.640 --> 52:36.020
her hair color even

52:36.020 --> 52:36.320
though they

52:36.320 --> 52:37.260
originally chose the

52:37.260 --> 52:37.700
person with

52:37.700 --> 52:38.420
different hair.

52:39.080 --> 52:39.760
We routinely

52:39.760 --> 52:40.620
fail to detect

52:40.620 --> 52:41.840
blatant mismatches

52:41.840 --> 52:42.640
between our actual

52:42.640 --> 52:43.660
choices and the

52:43.660 --> 52:44.420
outcomes presented

52:44.420 --> 52:44.820
to us.

52:45.640 --> 52:46.420
More importantly

52:46.420 --> 52:47.820
we will sincerely

52:47.820 --> 52:48.820
endorse a choice

52:48.820 --> 52:49.740
we never made.

52:51.040 --> 52:51.600
Introspective

52:51.600 --> 52:52.640
report, what you

52:52.640 --> 52:53.200
see when you

52:53.200 --> 52:53.840
look inside your

52:53.840 --> 52:54.920
own mind and

52:54.920 --> 52:55.620
ask yourself why

52:55.620 --> 52:56.380
you did something

52:56.380 --> 52:57.840
can radically

52:57.840 --> 52:59.460
wildly diverge

52:59.460 --> 53:00.240
from the actual

53:00.240 --> 53:00.980
causes of your

53:00.980 --> 53:01.380
behavior.

53:02.180 --> 53:02.780
So if we apply

53:02.780 --> 53:03.760
this back to

53:03.760 --> 53:04.380
the reverse

53:04.380 --> 53:05.820
centaur, it

53:05.820 --> 53:06.280
means that a

53:06.280 --> 53:07.260
person's sincere

53:07.260 --> 53:08.760
heartfelt endorsement

53:08.760 --> 53:09.300
of a corporate

53:09.300 --> 53:10.440
metric or a

53:10.440 --> 53:11.300
systemic purpose

53:11.300 --> 53:12.040
does not

53:12.040 --> 53:12.620
automatically

53:12.620 --> 53:13.340
establish that

53:13.340 --> 53:13.980
the purpose is

53:13.980 --> 53:15.380
authorized or

53:15.380 --> 53:16.020
truly their

53:16.020 --> 53:16.300
own.

53:17.240 --> 53:17.640
Flaccione

53:17.640 --> 53:18.600
formalizes this

53:18.600 --> 53:19.380
terrifying reality

53:19.380 --> 53:20.340
in theorems 12

53:20.340 --> 53:21.820
and 14 which

53:21.820 --> 53:22.900
explore the limits

53:22.900 --> 53:23.820
of introspection.

53:24.620 --> 53:25.020
Let's look at

53:25.020 --> 53:25.700
theorem 14.

53:26.020 --> 53:26.580
This is about

53:26.580 --> 53:27.300
reflection without

53:27.300 --> 53:28.080
new information,

53:28.280 --> 53:28.460
right?

53:28.980 --> 53:29.440
Yes.

53:30.120 --> 53:31.180
The theorem is a

53:31.180 --> 53:32.140
deterministic analog

53:32.140 --> 53:32.800
of something called

53:32.800 --> 53:34.040
the data processing

53:34.040 --> 53:35.100
inequality from

53:35.100 --> 53:35.840
information theory.

53:36.540 --> 53:37.280
In layman's terms

53:37.280 --> 53:38.600
it says that if you

53:38.600 --> 53:39.320
take a flawed,

53:39.560 --> 53:40.240
corrupted, or

53:40.240 --> 53:41.200
incomplete set of

53:41.200 --> 53:42.360
data and you just

53:42.360 --> 53:43.440
apply more internal

53:43.440 --> 53:44.360
processing to it,

53:44.360 --> 53:45.360
if you run it

53:45.360 --> 53:45.720
through more

53:45.720 --> 53:47.100
algorithms or in

53:47.100 --> 53:47.600
this case if you

53:47.600 --> 53:48.220
just sit in a room

53:48.220 --> 53:48.860
and think harder

53:48.860 --> 53:49.460
and harder about

53:49.460 --> 53:50.140
your own thoughts,

53:50.620 --> 53:52.060
you cannot magically

53:52.060 --> 53:53.240
generate new facts

53:53.240 --> 53:53.840
about the outside

53:53.840 --> 53:54.220
world.

53:54.880 --> 53:55.660
If the original data

53:55.660 --> 53:56.480
in my memory is

53:56.480 --> 53:57.020
corrupted by

53:57.020 --> 53:57.600
manipulation,

53:58.120 --> 53:58.940
spinning it around

53:58.940 --> 53:59.580
in my head a

53:59.580 --> 54:00.100
thousand times

54:00.100 --> 54:01.220
doesn't uncorrupt

54:01.220 --> 54:02.020
it, it just makes

54:02.020 --> 54:02.780
me more confident

54:02.780 --> 54:03.320
in the corrupted

54:03.320 --> 54:03.900
memory.

54:04.680 --> 54:05.120
Precisely.

54:05.760 --> 54:06.780
You can elaborate

54:06.780 --> 54:07.440
on your self

54:07.440 --> 54:08.960
description, weave a

54:08.960 --> 54:09.940
beautiful complex

54:09.940 --> 54:10.800
narrative about why

54:10.800 --> 54:11.720
you love your job

54:11.720 --> 54:12.820
or why hitting

54:12.820 --> 54:13.820
your KPIs is

54:13.820 --> 54:14.540
your true life's

54:14.540 --> 54:15.960
calling, but if

54:15.960 --> 54:16.580
that internal

54:16.580 --> 54:17.640
reflection doesn't

54:17.640 --> 54:18.600
introduce any new

54:18.600 --> 54:19.940
external distinguishing

54:19.940 --> 54:21.420
information, it

54:21.420 --> 54:22.340
cannot possibly tell

54:22.340 --> 54:23.480
you if you are in

54:23.480 --> 54:24.620
history one, free

54:24.620 --> 54:25.880
choice, or history

54:25.880 --> 54:27.040
two, manipulation.

54:27.680 --> 54:28.860
Introspection alone

54:28.860 --> 54:30.500
is entirely blind to

54:30.500 --> 54:31.000
the history that

54:31.000 --> 54:31.520
produced it.

54:32.260 --> 54:32.940
So if we can't

54:32.940 --> 54:33.560
trust our own

54:33.560 --> 54:34.480
internal feelings of

54:34.480 --> 54:35.500
satisfaction and we

54:35.500 --> 54:36.680
can't just meditate

54:36.680 --> 54:38.580
or think our way out

54:38.580 --> 54:40.240
of the trap, how do

54:40.240 --> 54:41.160
we ever find out the

54:41.160 --> 54:41.900
truth about our own

54:41.900 --> 54:42.320
lives?

54:42.660 --> 54:43.440
That is answered by

54:43.440 --> 54:44.460
theorem 13,

54:45.060 --> 54:46.320
discriminating inquiry.

54:47.300 --> 54:48.140
The paper points out

54:48.140 --> 54:49.020
that discovering the

54:49.020 --> 54:49.560
truth about your

54:49.560 --> 54:51.100
agency requires external

54:51.100 --> 54:52.000
observation and

54:52.000 --> 54:53.360
crucially, it requires

54:53.360 --> 54:53.960
friction.

54:54.700 --> 54:55.560
You have to introduce

54:55.560 --> 54:56.780
new variables into the

54:56.780 --> 54:57.060
system.

54:57.840 --> 54:58.540
What kind of friction?

54:59.200 --> 54:59.980
Give me an example.

55:00.380 --> 55:01.140
You have to test how

55:01.140 --> 55:02.220
the system responds to

55:02.220 --> 55:02.740
resistance.

55:03.760 --> 55:04.900
Remember, if a free

55:04.900 --> 55:05.700
arrangement and a

55:05.700 --> 55:06.620
manipulated arrangement

55:06.620 --> 55:07.760
look identical when you

55:07.760 --> 55:08.820
are perfectly compliant,

55:09.420 --> 55:10.340
you have to break the

55:10.340 --> 55:11.560
compliance to see the

55:11.560 --> 55:11.900
difference.

55:12.860 --> 55:13.660
What happens when you

55:13.660 --> 55:14.620
question the purpose?

55:15.300 --> 55:16.240
What happens when you

55:16.240 --> 55:17.260
formally request the

55:17.260 --> 55:18.300
original evidence that

55:18.300 --> 55:19.520
justified a specific

55:19.520 --> 55:19.840
metric?

55:20.580 --> 55:21.460
What happens when you

55:21.460 --> 55:22.280
attempt to take an

55:22.280 --> 55:23.840
obligation-preserving exit?

55:24.940 --> 55:25.800
Ah, I see.

55:26.420 --> 55:27.520
If I go to my boss and

55:27.520 --> 55:29.140
ask, hey, why are we

55:29.140 --> 55:30.440
prioritizing this specific

55:30.440 --> 55:31.200
tracking metric?

55:31.360 --> 55:32.120
It seems to be hurting

55:32.120 --> 55:32.460
morale.

55:32.980 --> 55:34.000
And my boss says,

55:34.120 --> 55:35.060
that's a fair question.

55:35.280 --> 55:35.920
Let's pull up the

55:35.920 --> 55:36.840
founding documents and

55:36.840 --> 55:37.800
review the data together.

55:37.800 --> 55:39.340
That is one kind of

55:39.340 --> 55:39.640
system.

55:40.240 --> 55:41.540
But if I ask the exact

55:41.540 --> 55:42.600
same question and the

55:42.600 --> 55:43.440
system immediately

55:43.440 --> 55:44.860
penalizes me, locks me

55:44.860 --> 55:46.100
out of my accounts, or

55:46.100 --> 55:47.260
HR calls me in to tell

55:47.260 --> 55:48.140
me that questioning the

55:48.140 --> 55:49.820
metric is a violation of

55:49.820 --> 55:50.820
our positive company

55:50.820 --> 55:52.640
culture, that friction

55:52.640 --> 55:54.160
tells me exactly what kind

55:54.160 --> 55:55.040
of system I am trapped

55:55.040 --> 55:55.300
in.

55:55.660 --> 55:56.060
Exactly.

55:56.520 --> 55:57.680
The system's response to

55:57.680 --> 55:58.800
resistance is the new

55:58.800 --> 56:00.200
data that breaks the

56:00.200 --> 56:00.960
historical under

56:00.960 --> 56:01.400
determination.

56:02.040 --> 56:03.020
You need outside help.

56:03.320 --> 56:04.160
You need access to

56:04.160 --> 56:04.960
external records.

56:04.960 --> 56:06.700
You need encounters with

56:06.700 --> 56:07.700
entirely different ways

56:07.700 --> 56:09.240
of living to figure out

56:09.240 --> 56:10.300
what your exclusively

56:10.300 --> 56:11.500
inward examination

56:11.500 --> 56:11.980
misses.

56:12.660 --> 56:13.320
You have to poke the

56:13.320 --> 56:14.260
cage to see if the bars

56:14.260 --> 56:15.500
are made of steel or

56:15.500 --> 56:16.080
just shadows.

56:16.440 --> 56:17.000
But hold on.

56:17.520 --> 56:18.520
This introduces a new

56:18.520 --> 56:18.880
problem.

56:19.540 --> 56:20.880
If we need outside help

56:20.880 --> 56:21.920
to examine our purposes,

56:22.660 --> 56:23.800
what happens when someone

56:23.800 --> 56:24.940
else starts asking us

56:24.940 --> 56:25.340
questions?

56:25.740 --> 56:27.300
If I am vulnerable to

56:27.300 --> 56:28.460
being a reverse centaur,

56:28.720 --> 56:29.840
and I know I can't trust

56:29.840 --> 56:30.760
my own introspection,

56:31.340 --> 56:33.000
can an outsider use that

56:33.000 --> 56:34.660
exact vulnerability against

56:34.660 --> 56:34.920
me?

56:35.360 --> 56:36.400
That is a phenomenal

56:36.400 --> 56:37.300
question, and it takes

56:37.300 --> 56:38.220
us directly into the

56:38.220 --> 56:39.620
dangers of being

56:39.620 --> 56:41.200
questioned, because the

56:41.200 --> 56:41.780
answer is yes.

56:42.400 --> 56:43.540
The very act of being

56:43.540 --> 56:44.840
interrogated can be a

56:44.840 --> 56:45.420
trap itself.

56:46.040 --> 56:46.780
Let's talk about the

56:46.780 --> 56:47.440
Socratic weapon.

56:48.100 --> 56:49.020
When I hear Socratic

56:49.020 --> 56:49.960
method, I usually think

56:49.960 --> 56:51.360
of a noble pursuit of

56:51.360 --> 56:51.680
truth.

56:52.420 --> 56:53.900
Socrates asks you gentle

56:53.900 --> 56:55.200
questions until you

56:55.200 --> 56:55.940
realize your own

56:55.940 --> 56:57.420
ignorance, and you both

56:57.420 --> 56:57.940
grow wiser.

56:58.500 --> 56:59.680
How can asking questions

56:59.680 --> 57:00.220
be a trap?

57:00.660 --> 57:02.120
Flyxion returns to Nietzsche

57:02.120 --> 57:03.960
here, looking at his

57:03.960 --> 57:05.120
highly hostile, cynical

57:05.120 --> 57:06.720
reading of Socratic

57:06.720 --> 57:08.600
irony, specifically in

57:08.600 --> 57:09.820
his passages analyzing

57:09.820 --> 57:11.000
dialectic and debate.

57:11.920 --> 57:12.760
Nietzsche saw the

57:12.760 --> 57:13.840
Socratic posture,

57:14.220 --> 57:15.080
professing ignorance,

57:15.260 --> 57:16.180
acting humble, and

57:16.180 --> 57:17.320
asking someone else to

57:17.320 --> 57:18.780
explain themselves, not

57:18.780 --> 57:19.920
as a search for truth,

57:20.420 --> 57:21.160
but as a weapon of

57:21.160 --> 57:21.540
power.

57:22.260 --> 57:23.400
It is a way for someone

57:23.400 --> 57:24.920
to forcefully reverse a

57:24.920 --> 57:26.700
hierarchy by dragging an

57:26.700 --> 57:27.480
opponent into a

57:27.480 --> 57:28.720
defensive, highly

57:28.720 --> 57:30.520
constrained, argumentative

57:30.520 --> 57:31.080
contest.

57:31.080 --> 57:32.540
The questioner actually

57:32.540 --> 57:33.820
holds all the power, even

57:33.820 --> 57:34.700
if they pretend not to

57:34.700 --> 57:35.160
know anything.

57:35.500 --> 57:35.720
Yes.

57:36.340 --> 57:37.060
The irony of the

57:37.060 --> 57:37.980
questioner sharpens the

57:37.980 --> 57:38.560
asymmetry.

57:39.440 --> 57:40.580
The questioner stays

57:40.580 --> 57:42.480
perfectly composed, acting

57:42.480 --> 57:43.440
like they just want to

57:43.440 --> 57:43.700
learn.

57:44.360 --> 57:45.120
Meanwhile, the person

57:45.120 --> 57:46.700
being interrogated gets

57:46.700 --> 57:48.200
flustered, angry, and

57:48.200 --> 57:49.160
struggles to defend the

57:49.160 --> 57:50.300
very foundations of their

57:50.300 --> 57:50.640
life.

57:51.200 --> 57:52.560
But they are forced to do

57:52.560 --> 57:54.500
it using a vocabulary and

57:54.500 --> 57:56.140
a framework entirely

57:56.140 --> 57:57.100
dictated by the

57:57.100 --> 57:57.540
questioner.

57:58.040 --> 57:59.200
The questioner controls

57:59.200 --> 57:59.960
the sequence of the

57:59.960 --> 58:00.920
questions, the allowed

58:00.920 --> 58:02.540
alternatives, and they get

58:02.540 --> 58:03.140
to highlight the

58:03.140 --> 58:04.080
contradictions that are

58:04.080 --> 58:04.780
brought into view.

58:05.240 --> 58:06.220
It reminds me of a

58:06.220 --> 58:07.640
hostile cross-examination

58:07.640 --> 58:08.160
in a courtroom.

58:08.440 --> 58:09.400
A skilled, aggressive

58:09.400 --> 58:10.680
lawyer can put an honest

58:10.680 --> 58:11.980
witness on the stand, ask

58:11.980 --> 58:13.060
them a series of rapid

58:13.060 --> 58:14.380
fire, highly constrained,

58:14.540 --> 58:16.140
yes or no questions, and

58:16.140 --> 58:17.540
successfully confuse the

58:17.540 --> 58:18.220
witness until they

58:18.220 --> 58:19.000
contradict themselves.

58:19.720 --> 58:21.040
The lawyer breaks the

58:21.040 --> 58:22.220
witness's testimony on the

58:22.220 --> 58:22.500
stand.

58:23.020 --> 58:24.060
But, and I think this is

58:24.060 --> 58:25.540
the crucial part, just

58:25.540 --> 58:26.300
because the lawyer

58:26.300 --> 58:28.000
successfully confused the

58:28.000 --> 58:29.020
witness, that doesn't

58:29.020 --> 58:29.680
mean the lawyer's

58:29.680 --> 58:30.820
version of events, is

58:30.820 --> 58:31.480
the truth.

58:31.920 --> 58:32.720
And it certainly doesn't

58:32.720 --> 58:34.180
mean the lawyer now owns

58:34.180 --> 58:35.480
the witness's life or gets

58:35.480 --> 58:36.680
to dictate their future.

58:37.440 --> 58:38.900
That analogy is perfect, and

58:38.900 --> 58:40.260
it maps exactly onto the

58:40.260 --> 58:41.840
mathematics of theorem 15

58:41.840 --> 58:43.020
in the paper, titled

58:43.020 --> 58:44.360
Defeat is Neither

58:44.360 --> 58:45.880
Falsity Nor Authority.

58:46.280 --> 58:47.340
Let's break that theorem

58:47.340 --> 58:48.400
down, because I think this

58:48.400 --> 58:49.240
happens in corporate

58:49.240 --> 58:50.440
meeting rooms and political

58:50.440 --> 58:51.840
debates every single day.

58:52.300 --> 58:53.700
It is a two-part proof.

58:54.300 --> 58:55.920
Part A proves that if you

58:55.920 --> 58:57.500
suffer a dialectical defeat,

58:57.500 --> 58:58.800
meaning a questioner

58:58.800 --> 59:00.140
successfully traps you in a

59:00.140 --> 59:01.620
logical contradiction, and

59:01.620 --> 59:02.440
you cannot adequately

59:02.440 --> 59:03.700
justify your purpose under

59:03.700 --> 59:05.040
their specific rules of

59:05.040 --> 59:06.760
debate, that does not

59:06.760 --> 59:08.060
mathematically mean your

59:08.060 --> 59:08.940
original claim was

59:08.940 --> 59:09.320
false.

59:09.860 --> 59:10.160
Why not?

59:10.640 --> 59:11.600
If I can't defend my

59:11.600 --> 59:12.420
belief, isn't it by

59:12.420 --> 59:13.560
definition false or

59:13.560 --> 59:14.200
unjustified?

59:14.660 --> 59:15.420
Not necessarily.

59:15.880 --> 59:17.000
You might simply lack the

59:17.000 --> 59:18.560
specific vocabulary, the

59:18.560 --> 59:20.880
historical data, or the

59:20.880 --> 59:22.020
time permitted by the

59:22.020 --> 59:23.100
arbitrary rules of that

59:23.100 --> 59:24.100
specific exchange.

59:24.100 --> 59:25.780
If I demand that you

59:25.780 --> 59:27.080
explain the nuances of

59:27.080 --> 59:28.180
quantum physics to me in

59:28.180 --> 59:29.760
five seconds, using only

59:29.760 --> 59:30.720
words that start with the

59:30.720 --> 59:32.400
letter B, you will fail.

59:33.220 --> 59:34.260
Your failure to defend

59:34.260 --> 59:35.560
quantum physics under those

59:35.560 --> 59:37.000
conditions does not mean

59:37.000 --> 59:38.560
quantum physics is false.

59:39.300 --> 59:40.120
It simply means my

59:40.120 --> 59:41.220
interrogation rules were

59:41.220 --> 59:42.320
explicitly designed to

59:42.320 --> 59:43.180
ensure your failure.

59:43.580 --> 59:43.860
Right.

59:44.140 --> 59:45.160
The game was rigged.

59:45.420 --> 59:46.240
And Part B of the

59:46.240 --> 59:46.460
theorem?

59:47.080 --> 59:48.220
Part B is even more

59:48.220 --> 59:48.640
profound.

59:49.220 --> 59:51.220
It proves mathematically that

59:51.220 --> 59:53.180
diagnostic defeat does not

59:53.180 --> 59:54.340
grant the questioner the

59:54.340 --> 59:55.660
authority to choose your

59:55.660 --> 59:56.220
new ends.

59:56.960 --> 59:57.900
Even if the questioner

59:57.900 --> 59:59.140
genuinely refutes your

59:59.140 --> 01:00:00.700
justification, even if

01:00:00.700 --> 01:00:02.280
they expose a very real,

01:00:02.380 --> 01:00:03.060
very embarrassing

01:00:03.060 --> 01:00:04.200
contradiction in your

01:00:04.200 --> 01:00:06.320
life, that success in an

01:00:06.320 --> 01:00:07.840
argumentative exchange does

01:00:07.840 --> 01:00:09.340
not magically rewrite the

01:00:09.340 --> 01:00:10.580
authorization record to

01:00:10.580 --> 01:00:12.400
say the questioner is now

01:00:12.400 --> 01:00:12.940
your boss.

01:00:13.620 --> 01:00:14.760
Defeating my argument

01:00:14.760 --> 01:00:15.900
doesn't give you ownership

01:00:15.900 --> 01:00:16.900
of my agency.

01:00:17.600 --> 01:00:18.640
Exposing a flaw in my

01:00:18.640 --> 01:00:19.900
reasoning doesn't grant you

01:00:19.900 --> 01:00:21.640
legitimate, purpose-setting

01:00:21.640 --> 01:00:22.740
authority over my life.

01:00:22.740 --> 01:00:23.340
Exactly.

01:00:24.400 --> 01:00:25.200
The structural abuse

01:00:25.200 --> 01:00:26.420
occurs when a failure to

01:00:26.420 --> 01:00:27.620
satisfy the questioner's

01:00:27.620 --> 01:00:29.620
specific test is treated as

01:00:29.620 --> 01:00:31.000
a total surrender of your

01:00:31.000 --> 01:00:31.380
standing.

01:00:32.260 --> 01:00:33.040
The interrogation's

01:00:33.040 --> 01:00:34.220
criteria suddenly acquire

01:00:34.220 --> 01:00:35.400
authority without ever

01:00:35.400 --> 01:00:36.300
passing verification

01:00:36.300 --> 01:00:37.020
themselves.

01:00:37.940 --> 01:00:38.880
You collapse into the

01:00:38.880 --> 01:00:39.720
questioner's preferred

01:00:39.720 --> 01:00:41.520
conclusion just because you

01:00:41.520 --> 01:00:42.760
got flustered and lost a

01:00:42.760 --> 01:00:43.040
debate.

01:00:43.420 --> 01:00:44.400
And the paper points out

01:00:44.400 --> 01:00:45.840
that large organizations do

01:00:45.840 --> 01:00:47.320
this intentionally, right?

01:00:47.400 --> 01:00:48.880
They script these exchanges

01:00:48.880 --> 01:00:50.400
to maintain the illusion of

01:00:50.400 --> 01:00:50.760
consent.

01:00:50.760 --> 01:00:51.240
Yes.

01:00:51.640 --> 01:00:53.480
Theorem 16 tackles scripted

01:00:53.480 --> 01:00:54.040
exchanges.

01:00:54.920 --> 01:00:56.180
It looks at a scenario where

01:00:56.180 --> 01:00:57.540
an interrogation or a

01:00:57.540 --> 01:00:59.280
feedback session is entirely

01:00:59.280 --> 01:01:01.000
rigidly scripted by the

01:01:01.000 --> 01:01:01.380
controller.

01:01:02.140 --> 01:01:02.820
The questions are

01:01:02.820 --> 01:01:04.500
predetermined, the sequence

01:01:04.500 --> 01:01:06.200
is locked, and the allowed

01:01:06.200 --> 01:01:07.800
answers are constrained by a

01:01:07.800 --> 01:01:08.360
tight script.

01:01:09.100 --> 01:01:10.820
Like a forced corporate

01:01:10.820 --> 01:01:12.020
compliance survey where the

01:01:12.020 --> 01:01:13.620
only options are agree or

01:01:13.620 --> 01:01:15.660
strongly agree, or a show

01:01:15.660 --> 01:01:16.620
trial in a dictatorship.

01:01:16.620 --> 01:01:17.580
Exactly.

01:01:18.360 --> 01:01:19.800
The theorem proves that if an

01:01:19.800 --> 01:01:21.280
exchange is completely fixed

01:01:21.280 --> 01:01:23.100
by a script, it adds

01:01:23.100 --> 01:01:24.660
absolutely zero new

01:01:24.660 --> 01:01:25.640
information about the

01:01:25.640 --> 01:01:26.740
underlying history of the

01:01:26.740 --> 01:01:27.060
system.

01:01:27.600 --> 01:01:28.540
It cannot logically

01:01:28.540 --> 01:01:29.640
discriminate between a

01:01:29.640 --> 01:01:31.580
history of free choice and a

01:01:31.580 --> 01:01:32.440
history of brutal

01:01:32.440 --> 01:01:33.160
manipulation.

01:01:33.820 --> 01:01:35.320
Because the script forces the

01:01:35.320 --> 01:01:36.860
exact same answers regardless

01:01:36.860 --> 01:01:38.240
of what the true history is.

01:01:38.400 --> 01:01:38.900
Precisely.

01:01:39.400 --> 01:01:40.540
A transcript that shows

01:01:40.540 --> 01:01:42.660
smooth, unbroken, 100%

01:01:42.660 --> 01:01:44.160
agreement between a worker and

01:01:44.160 --> 01:01:45.900
a corporate script is not

01:01:45.900 --> 01:01:47.280
evidence of genuine consent.

01:01:48.060 --> 01:01:49.480
It is evidence of a rigged

01:01:49.480 --> 01:01:49.840
game.

01:01:50.480 --> 01:01:52.780
It is structural evidence that

01:01:52.780 --> 01:01:54.200
the exchange had absolutely

01:01:54.200 --> 01:01:56.500
no power to actually examine

01:01:56.500 --> 01:01:56.980
the truth.

01:01:57.660 --> 01:01:57.920
Wow.

01:01:58.280 --> 01:01:59.620
Okay, so if we take a step

01:01:59.620 --> 01:02:01.080
back and look at the landscape

01:02:01.080 --> 01:02:02.720
we've mapped out, we are

01:02:02.720 --> 01:02:04.260
faced with two distinct

01:02:04.260 --> 01:02:06.140
massive threats to our agency.

01:02:06.620 --> 01:02:08.040
On one hand, because of our

01:02:08.040 --> 01:02:09.700
own psychological blind spots

01:02:09.700 --> 01:02:10.780
and the limits of

01:02:10.780 --> 01:02:12.280
introspection, we can be

01:02:12.280 --> 01:02:14.220
completely oblivious to how

01:02:14.220 --> 01:02:15.520
our purposes were implanted

01:02:15.520 --> 01:02:15.940
in us.

01:02:16.300 --> 01:02:17.300
We lack the ability to

01:02:17.300 --> 01:02:18.480
diagnose the trap.

01:02:18.980 --> 01:02:20.300
On the other hand, because

01:02:20.300 --> 01:02:21.820
of the physical geometry of

01:02:21.820 --> 01:02:23.420
the system, the excluded

01:02:23.420 --> 01:02:24.860
cuts, the fake nominal

01:02:24.860 --> 01:02:26.480
exits, the depletion

01:02:26.480 --> 01:02:27.800
horizons, we can be

01:02:27.800 --> 01:02:28.960
physically or

01:02:28.960 --> 01:02:30.400
organizationally prevented

01:02:30.400 --> 01:02:31.880
from fixing the problem

01:02:31.880 --> 01:02:33.540
even if we do manage to

01:02:33.540 --> 01:02:33.880
see it.

01:02:34.180 --> 01:02:35.280
And that precise dual threat

01:02:35.280 --> 01:02:36.720
brings us to the climax of

01:02:36.720 --> 01:02:37.060
the paper.

01:02:37.420 --> 01:02:38.840
The final synthesis in

01:02:38.840 --> 01:02:41.100
theorem 17 and the dual

01:02:41.100 --> 01:02:42.640
mandate of answerability.

01:02:43.120 --> 01:02:44.760
Let's synthesize this whole

01:02:44.760 --> 01:02:45.220
deep dive.

01:02:45.720 --> 01:02:47.320
How do those two threats,

01:02:47.660 --> 01:02:49.100
the inability to diagnose

01:02:49.100 --> 01:02:50.620
and the inability to

01:02:50.620 --> 01:02:52.300
correct, actually relate to

01:02:52.300 --> 01:02:52.660
each other?

01:02:53.420 --> 01:02:54.760
The theorem 17 proves the

01:02:54.760 --> 01:02:56.240
independence of discrimination

01:02:56.240 --> 01:02:57.300
and correction.

01:02:58.000 --> 01:02:59.320
It demonstrates mathematically

01:02:59.320 --> 01:03:01.040
that these two failures are

01:03:01.040 --> 01:03:03.220
entirely logically independent

01:03:03.220 --> 01:03:03.900
of one another.

01:03:04.460 --> 01:03:05.500
Neither one automatically

01:03:05.500 --> 01:03:07.120
implies the other, and all

01:03:07.120 --> 01:03:08.900
possible combinations can and

01:03:08.900 --> 01:03:10.540
do exist in the real world.

01:03:11.140 --> 01:03:12.720
Okay, let's visualize this.

01:03:13.160 --> 01:03:14.700
Give me a concrete analogy to

01:03:14.700 --> 01:03:15.880
explain how they are

01:03:15.880 --> 01:03:16.280
independent.

01:03:16.900 --> 01:03:18.020
Let's use a medical analogy.

01:03:18.400 --> 01:03:19.600
Think about dealing with a

01:03:19.600 --> 01:03:21.360
severe, hidden illness.

01:03:21.740 --> 01:03:22.040
Okay.

01:03:22.900 --> 01:03:24.040
Discrimination is the

01:03:24.040 --> 01:03:25.100
equivalent of getting a

01:03:25.100 --> 01:03:26.720
perfect MRI scan and a

01:03:26.720 --> 01:03:27.180
blood test.

01:03:27.540 --> 01:03:29.460
It is the diagnostic evidence.

01:03:30.100 --> 01:03:31.240
You look at the lab results,

01:03:31.460 --> 01:03:32.720
and you know the absolute

01:03:32.720 --> 01:03:34.500
true history and current state

01:03:34.500 --> 01:03:35.760
of the disease in your body.

01:03:35.760 --> 01:03:38.380
You have perfect discrimination.

01:03:39.640 --> 01:03:40.960
Correction, on the other hand,

01:03:41.320 --> 01:03:42.580
is whether or not a cure

01:03:42.580 --> 01:03:44.240
actually exists and is

01:03:44.240 --> 01:03:45.240
accessible to you.

01:03:45.980 --> 01:03:46.980
It's the medicine on the

01:03:46.980 --> 01:03:47.220
shelf.

01:03:48.380 --> 01:03:50.400
Theorem 17 says the diagnosis

01:03:50.400 --> 01:03:51.260
and the cure are

01:03:51.260 --> 01:03:52.680
mathematically independent.

01:03:53.500 --> 01:03:53.860
I see.

01:03:53.980 --> 01:03:55.480
So I could have total

01:03:55.480 --> 01:03:56.960
discrimination, but zero

01:03:56.960 --> 01:03:57.440
correction.

01:03:57.720 --> 01:03:57.980
Yes.

01:03:58.400 --> 01:03:59.300
You get the MRI.

01:03:59.660 --> 01:04:01.100
The doctor tells you exactly

01:04:01.100 --> 01:04:01.840
what is wrong.

01:04:02.240 --> 01:04:03.660
You see the reality of the

01:04:03.660 --> 01:04:05.780
illness perfectly, but there

01:04:05.780 --> 01:04:06.320
is no cure.

01:04:06.980 --> 01:04:08.420
The disease is untreatable.

01:04:08.880 --> 01:04:10.120
You have perfect diagnostic

01:04:10.120 --> 01:04:12.180
evidence of your capture, but

01:04:12.180 --> 01:04:13.740
absolutely zero corrective

01:04:13.740 --> 01:04:14.100
paths.

01:04:14.680 --> 01:04:16.440
You know you're dying, but you

01:04:16.440 --> 01:04:17.400
can't do anything about it.

01:04:18.080 --> 01:04:19.300
That sounds exactly like

01:04:19.300 --> 01:04:20.880
burnout in a highly toxic,

01:04:21.100 --> 01:04:21.940
inescapable job.

01:04:22.360 --> 01:04:23.880
You know exactly how bad the

01:04:23.880 --> 01:04:24.460
system is.

01:04:24.600 --> 01:04:25.660
You see all the structural

01:04:25.660 --> 01:04:26.140
flaws.

01:04:26.540 --> 01:04:27.680
You have perfect discrimination.

01:04:28.280 --> 01:04:29.880
But you are living paycheck to

01:04:29.880 --> 01:04:30.160
paycheck.

01:04:30.540 --> 01:04:32.060
You have zero financial ability

01:04:32.060 --> 01:04:33.640
to quit, so you have zero

01:04:33.640 --> 01:04:34.300
correction.

01:04:34.760 --> 01:04:36.340
You are just trapped in the

01:04:36.340 --> 01:04:36.980
knowledge of it.

01:04:37.200 --> 01:04:37.600
Exactly.

01:04:38.000 --> 01:04:38.920
It's a tragic state.

01:04:39.660 --> 01:04:40.820
But now, flip it.

01:04:41.380 --> 01:04:42.620
The math says you could also

01:04:42.620 --> 01:04:44.480
have perfect correction, but

01:04:44.480 --> 01:04:45.960
absolutely zero discrimination.

01:04:46.740 --> 01:04:47.700
What does that look like?

01:04:48.280 --> 01:04:49.500
That is when the cure is

01:04:49.500 --> 01:04:50.720
hitting right there on your

01:04:50.720 --> 01:04:51.260
kitchen counter.

01:04:51.760 --> 01:04:52.300
It's cheap.

01:04:52.380 --> 01:04:52.960
It's accessible.

01:04:53.500 --> 01:04:54.640
The path to correction is

01:04:54.640 --> 01:04:55.740
wide open and fully

01:04:55.740 --> 01:04:56.120
permitted.

01:04:56.900 --> 01:04:58.180
But because your internal

01:04:58.180 --> 01:04:59.460
systems are masking the

01:04:59.460 --> 01:05:01.020
symptoms, or because you've

01:05:01.020 --> 01:05:02.120
convinced yourself you feel

01:05:02.120 --> 01:05:04.000
fine, you never go to the

01:05:04.000 --> 01:05:04.240
doctor.

01:05:04.820 --> 01:05:05.900
You never get the diagnosis.

01:05:06.640 --> 01:05:07.380
You don't take the medicine

01:05:07.380 --> 01:05:08.320
because you don't know you're

01:05:08.320 --> 01:05:08.600
sick.

01:05:09.100 --> 01:05:09.460
Exactly.

01:05:10.180 --> 01:05:11.200
The door is wide open.

01:05:11.860 --> 01:05:12.900
The system is completely

01:05:12.900 --> 01:05:13.420
permissive.

01:05:13.500 --> 01:05:14.880
There are no excluded cuts.

01:05:15.560 --> 01:05:17.080
But you have been so thoroughly

01:05:17.080 --> 01:05:18.480
adapted to the system's

01:05:18.480 --> 01:05:20.580
narrative, you are so deeply

01:05:20.580 --> 01:05:22.760
choice blind, that you never

01:05:22.760 --> 01:05:23.700
even attempt to leave.

01:05:24.660 --> 01:05:26.760
Your introspection tells you

01:05:26.760 --> 01:05:28.140
that staying is your deepest,

01:05:28.400 --> 01:05:29.560
most authentic desire.

01:05:29.560 --> 01:05:31.760
You are a perfectly

01:05:31.760 --> 01:05:33.320
comfortable, completely

01:05:33.320 --> 01:05:35.400
oblivious, reverse centaur.

01:05:36.220 --> 01:05:37.540
And of course, in many real

01:05:37.540 --> 01:05:38.820
world bureaucratic systems,

01:05:38.940 --> 01:05:39.920
these two failures are

01:05:39.920 --> 01:05:41.540
intentionally coupled by the

01:05:41.540 --> 01:05:42.180
people in power.

01:05:42.960 --> 01:05:44.180
An organization that actively

01:05:44.180 --> 01:05:45.300
suppresses evidence and

01:05:45.300 --> 01:05:46.480
audits, destroying

01:05:46.480 --> 01:05:48.000
discrimination, is usually

01:05:48.000 --> 01:05:49.380
the exact same kind of

01:05:49.380 --> 01:05:50.400
organization that uses

01:05:50.400 --> 01:05:51.540
non-competes and aggressive

01:05:51.540 --> 01:05:52.820
contracts to remove exit

01:05:52.820 --> 01:05:54.060
paths, destroying

01:05:54.060 --> 01:05:54.540
correction.

01:05:55.100 --> 01:05:56.420
They absolutely are coupled

01:05:56.420 --> 01:05:56.980
in practice.

01:05:56.980 --> 01:05:58.800
But mathematically, Flaxen

01:05:58.800 --> 01:05:59.920
proves they are separate

01:05:59.920 --> 01:06:00.720
vulnerabilities.

01:06:01.860 --> 01:06:02.720
And because they are

01:06:02.720 --> 01:06:04.280
separate, if you want to

01:06:04.280 --> 01:06:06.160
keep power answerable, you

01:06:06.160 --> 01:06:07.300
cannot just defend one.

01:06:07.420 --> 01:06:08.700
You must explicitly,

01:06:09.140 --> 01:06:10.140
structurally defend both.

01:06:11.020 --> 01:06:12.620
So after all of this, after

01:06:12.620 --> 01:06:14.120
mapping the Nietzschean trap,

01:06:14.400 --> 01:06:15.920
the binding beyond scope, the

01:06:15.920 --> 01:06:17.800
danger of scalar metrics, the

01:06:17.800 --> 01:06:20.060
excluded cuts, and the flaws of

01:06:20.060 --> 01:06:22.160
introspection, what is the

01:06:22.160 --> 01:06:22.940
actual solution?

01:06:23.100 --> 01:06:24.860
How does Flaxen say we can

01:06:24.860 --> 01:06:26.480
maintain our agency in a world

01:06:26.480 --> 01:06:28.000
built on delegated systems?

01:06:28.140 --> 01:06:28.820
What is the mandate?

01:06:29.380 --> 01:06:30.680
Flaxen doesn't just leave us

01:06:30.680 --> 01:06:31.620
with the diagnosis.

01:06:31.940 --> 01:06:33.320
They outline a very specific

01:06:33.320 --> 01:06:34.700
set of structural requirements

01:06:34.700 --> 01:06:37.020
for any organization, software,

01:06:37.200 --> 01:06:38.980
or society if it wants to keep

01:06:38.980 --> 01:06:40.920
power genuinely answerable to

01:06:40.920 --> 01:06:41.540
human agency.

01:06:42.040 --> 01:06:42.780
Let's go through them.

01:06:42.900 --> 01:06:44.020
What is the first requirement?

01:06:44.660 --> 01:06:46.620
First, we must insist on scoped

01:06:46.620 --> 01:06:48.800
delegations with strict return

01:06:48.800 --> 01:06:49.340
conditions.

01:06:50.000 --> 01:06:51.900
Meaning, I will agree to execute

01:06:51.900 --> 01:06:53.880
this task automatically, but only

01:06:53.880 --> 01:06:54.840
under these very

01:06:54.860 --> 01:06:56.640
specific bounded conditions.

01:06:57.280 --> 01:06:59.680
And if condition X, Y, or Z

01:06:59.680 --> 01:07:01.220
changes in the environment, my

01:07:01.220 --> 01:07:03.260
automatic compliance stops and

01:07:03.260 --> 01:07:04.720
explicit authority returns to

01:07:04.720 --> 01:07:04.880
me.

01:07:05.200 --> 01:07:05.460
Yes.

01:07:05.800 --> 01:07:07.280
The relegation must have a leash.

01:07:08.040 --> 01:07:10.400
Second, we need admissibility

01:07:10.400 --> 01:07:12.780
tests that precede optimization.

01:07:13.540 --> 01:07:14.760
We have to structurally check the

01:07:14.760 --> 01:07:17.040
provenance of the goal and the

01:07:17.040 --> 01:07:18.980
ethical side constraints before we

01:07:18.980 --> 01:07:20.420
ever turn on the machine that

01:07:20.420 --> 01:07:21.520
maximizes the score.

01:07:22.080 --> 01:07:23.480
No more glitching the game just to

01:07:23.480 --> 01:07:24.400
get to the top of the leader

01:07:24.400 --> 01:07:24.700
scoreboard.

01:07:25.060 --> 01:07:26.540
The scoreboard cannot be the

01:07:26.540 --> 01:07:27.620
supreme law of the land.

01:07:28.340 --> 01:07:29.740
Third, and this addresses the

01:07:29.740 --> 01:07:31.700
graph theory, we need corrective

01:07:31.700 --> 01:07:33.240
paths that controllers are not

01:07:33.240 --> 01:07:35.120
legally or structurally allowed to

01:07:35.120 --> 01:07:35.460
close.

01:07:35.980 --> 01:07:37.320
There must always be a feasible,

01:07:38.040 --> 01:07:39.960
obligation-preserving way for an

01:07:39.960 --> 01:07:42.200
agent to contest a mandate or

01:07:42.200 --> 01:07:43.480
safely exit the arrangement.

01:07:44.140 --> 01:07:46.320
The excluded cut cannot be allowed to

01:07:46.320 --> 01:07:46.520
form.

01:07:46.520 --> 01:07:49.660
We need a real, safe emergency exit,

01:07:49.660 --> 01:07:52.080
not a nominal, fake exit that forces

01:07:52.080 --> 01:07:53.840
me to destroy my livelihood to use

01:07:53.840 --> 01:07:54.060
it.

01:07:54.920 --> 01:07:56.380
And finally, to combat choice

01:07:56.380 --> 01:07:58.580
blindness, we need guaranteed access

01:07:58.580 --> 01:08:00.400
to evidence that challenges the

01:08:00.400 --> 01:08:02.040
organization's own account of its

01:08:02.040 --> 01:08:02.420
purposes.

01:08:02.780 --> 01:08:04.860
We need to actively invite the friction

01:08:04.860 --> 01:08:06.240
of outside observation.

01:08:06.980 --> 01:08:09.220
We need the ability to safely test the

01:08:09.220 --> 01:08:10.760
system's response to resistance.

01:08:10.760 --> 01:08:13.180
And we need the right to maintain

01:08:13.180 --> 01:08:15.460
independent records of how decisions

01:08:15.460 --> 01:08:16.440
were actually made.

01:08:17.380 --> 01:08:19.460
A system's shiny, highly produced PR

01:08:19.460 --> 01:08:21.640
narrative can never be accepted as the

01:08:21.640 --> 01:08:22.640
only permitted history.

01:08:22.640 --> 01:08:23.480
Wow.

01:08:23.980 --> 01:08:27.180
That is an incredibly robust, rigorous, and

01:08:27.180 --> 01:08:28.940
demanding way to look at how we engage

01:08:28.940 --> 01:08:29.420
with the world.

01:08:29.960 --> 01:08:31.800
We have covered an immense amount of

01:08:31.800 --> 01:08:33.020
ground today, and I think we've

01:08:33.020 --> 01:08:34.680
completely reframed how we should look

01:08:34.680 --> 01:08:36.180
at competence and success.

01:08:36.500 --> 01:08:38.080
We started with the image of a master

01:08:38.080 --> 01:08:40.420
carpenter blindly executing blueprints,

01:08:40.620 --> 01:08:42.360
and we traced that all the way to the

01:08:42.360 --> 01:08:45.080
modern reverse centaur, acting as the

01:08:45.080 --> 01:08:46.780
biological hands for a corporate

01:08:46.780 --> 01:08:48.820
algorithm or a moral doctrine.

01:08:49.640 --> 01:08:51.920
We explored how the very virtues we

01:08:51.920 --> 01:08:53.940
prize, like being industrious and

01:08:53.940 --> 01:08:56.080
obedient, can actually be the handles

01:08:56.080 --> 01:08:57.040
used to trap us.

01:08:57.640 --> 01:08:59.500
We mathematically proved that high

01:08:59.500 --> 01:09:01.720
scores can easily mask illegitimate

01:09:01.720 --> 01:09:03.700
goals, and we saw how a single

01:09:03.700 --> 01:09:06.720
squashed scalar metric can utterly

01:09:06.720 --> 01:09:08.500
destroy vital ethical distinctions.

01:09:08.840 --> 01:09:10.580
We looked at the literal geometry of

01:09:10.580 --> 01:09:11.040
our choices.

01:09:11.660 --> 01:09:13.500
We mapped out the danger of fake exits,

01:09:13.900 --> 01:09:15.840
and we looked at the terrifying, quiet

01:09:15.840 --> 01:09:18.520
math of the depletion horizon, where our

01:09:18.520 --> 01:09:20.580
options slowly run out while we are too

01:09:20.580 --> 01:09:21.880
busy working to notice.

01:09:22.820 --> 01:09:24.220
We learn the hard truth about our own

01:09:24.220 --> 01:09:26.280
minds, that we cannot always trust our

01:09:26.280 --> 01:09:28.540
own internal feelings of endorsement, and

01:09:28.540 --> 01:09:30.240
that a scripted interrogation, no matter

01:09:30.240 --> 01:09:32.860
how polite it seems, is often just a trap

01:09:32.860 --> 01:09:34.400
designed to force our compliance.

01:09:34.940 --> 01:09:36.520
And ultimately, the most profound

01:09:36.520 --> 01:09:39.660
takeaway is that to be truly free, to have

01:09:39.660 --> 01:09:42.240
actual human agency, we need both the

01:09:42.240 --> 01:09:44.500
diagnostic evidence to see the bars of the

01:09:44.500 --> 01:09:47.340
cage and the unimpeded path to walk out of

01:09:47.340 --> 01:09:48.340
it.

01:09:48.340 --> 01:09:50.780
Flawless execution, massive profits, and

01:09:50.780 --> 01:09:52.640
incredible efficiency mean absolutely

01:09:52.640 --> 01:09:54.600
nothing if we are trapped serving

01:09:54.600 --> 01:09:55.560
unexamined ends.

01:09:55.560 --> 01:09:58.120
Thank you so much for joining us on this deep

01:09:58.120 --> 01:09:59.980
dive into the architecture of agency.

01:09:59.980 --> 01:10:01.200
It's a dense topic.

01:10:01.580 --> 01:10:03.760
It requires a lot of processing, but it

01:10:03.760 --> 01:10:05.460
provides a lens that fundamentally,

01:10:06.060 --> 01:10:08.000
permanently, changes how you look at the

01:10:08.000 --> 01:10:10.000
systems you interact with every single

01:10:10.000 --> 01:10:10.280
day.

01:10:10.720 --> 01:10:12.760
And as we wrap up, I want to leave you with a

01:10:12.760 --> 01:10:15.340
final lingering thought to mull over as you

01:10:15.340 --> 01:10:16.040
go back to your day.

01:10:16.040 --> 01:10:19.120
I want you to think about the apps and the

01:10:19.120 --> 01:10:21.360
systems you use on your phone right now, the

01:10:21.360 --> 01:10:23.940
apps that track your daily productivity, the

01:10:23.940 --> 01:10:25.820
software that monitors the quality of your

01:10:25.820 --> 01:10:28.700
sleep, the platforms that gamify your personal

01:10:28.700 --> 01:10:31.620
growth with badges and streaks and constant

01:10:31.620 --> 01:10:32.220
high scores.

01:10:32.840 --> 01:10:35.460
Look closely at how flawlessly you are executing

01:10:35.460 --> 01:10:36.120
those tasks.

01:10:36.720 --> 01:10:39.200
Are you actually using those systems as a true

01:10:39.200 --> 01:10:42.260
centaur, directing their computational power to

01:10:42.260 --> 01:10:45.560
achieve a legitimately authorized goal that you

01:10:45.560 --> 01:10:50.120
derived for yourself or have you slowly, comfortably

01:10:50.120 --> 01:10:53.420
over time become the most reliable, high-scoring

01:10:53.420 --> 01:10:56.400
actuator for a purpose you never actually chose?

01:10:56.960 --> 01:10:58.540
Until next time, keep diving.

